{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">資深演員駱達華早年憑經典劇集《陀槍師姐II》分飾「鮑國平」及「翁文成」，成為無數觀眾的「童年陰影」，近年他主力轉戰內地發展。日前有網民在內地平民小店用餐時「捕獲」駱達華並將其近況上載社交平台，引來大批網民熱議。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ff7b45ed-e75b-4458-8227-f702f67aaa67.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026BlZ3Qo9SQA1784711444.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ff7b45ed-e75b-4458-8227-f702f67aaa67.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">相片中身穿休閒服飾的駱達華坐在簡樸小店內用餐，年過半百的他保養得宜、身形極Fit，且展現親和力的慈祥笑容，與昔日螢幕上的冷酷狠辣形象形成強烈反差萌。有網民留言笑言：「吃個飯遇到了小時候的童年陰影，這個角色太過深刻，以至於這麼多年一直以為本人就叫鮑國平。」</p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"69496939-b058-4191-92ef-10152084836b.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026XedNqJ831D1784711449.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"69496939-b058-4191-92ef-10152084836b.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">大批劇迷的回憶亦被喚起，紛紛稱讚他「比年輕的時候更帥了，面相很好」、「笑起來好溫柔」、「同馮德倫有啲似」、「型佬味濃」；不過也有觀眾入戲太深，留言笑稱「你還在嗎？留個言報個平安」及「因為他，我長那麼大了還是很害怕漁夫帽。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-26T04:18:15.627324+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":345,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}